OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested by police after
OL,4,Apedestrian hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested by police after
OL,7,Fa pedestrian was hit by a car, leaving
OL,8,Fhim in a life-threatening condition.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fcame across the collision on the A15 in
OL,12,FPeterborough just after 22:30 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FA 30-year-old man from Peterborough
OL,16,Fsuffered serious injures and was taken
OL,17,Fto Addenbrooke's Hospital.
OL,19,FThe driver, a 25-year-old man from
OL,20,FPeterborough, was arrested on suspicion
OL,21,Fof drug driving and causing serious
OL,22,Finjury by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
